    "body": "`max_cache` is known ahead of time in this test as a `size_t` of `10000`, and each of these calculations should be known ahead of time (500.0, 9500.0). This test can truncate the double and assert exact equality rather than use a tolerance. Found in #35713 whereby this is the only use of this macro in the unit tests. IMO it is appropriate to tighten this test and remove the macro.",
